---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang);
---

<section data-demo="github" lang={lang}>
  <header>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Public weather widget · contribution example",
        "공개 날씨 위젯 · 기여 예시",
        "公開の天気ウィジェット · 貢献の例",
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>
      {t(
        "A proposal crosses the boundary.",
        "경계를 넘는 것은 수정 제안",
        "境界を越えるのは変更の提案",
      )}
    </h2>
  </header>
  <div class="review-map">
    <aside class="contributor" data-contributor>
      <span class="role">{t("Contributor", "기여자", "貢献者")}</span>
      <h3>{t("Their fork", "자신의 fork", "自分のfork")}</h3>
      <p class="patch">
        <code>rain-label</code>
        <br />
        {t("Fix rain label", "비 예보 문구 수정", "雨予報の文言を修正")}
      </p>
      <p>
        {t("Push a branch here", "여기에 브랜치 push", "ここへブランチをpush")}
      </p>
      <b class="proposal">
        {t("01 / Open PR →", "01 / PR 열기 →", "01 / PRを開く →")}
      </b>
      <p class="no-write">
        {t(
          "No upstream write permission",
          "원본 쓰기 권한 없음",
          "元のリポジトリへの書き込み権限なし",
        )}
      </p>
    </aside>
    <div class="maintainer" data-maintainer>
      <span class="role">
        {t(
          "Maintainer’s repository",
          "관리자의 저장소",
          "保守担当者のリポジトリ",
        )}
      </span>
      <div class="request" data-review>
        <h3>
          {t(
            "Pull request · proposed change",
            "PR · 제안된 변경",
            "PR · 提案された変更",
          )}
        </h3>
        <ol>
          <li>
            <b>02</b>
            <span>{t("Review the diff", "차이 검토", "差分をレビュー")}</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <b>03</b>
            <span>
              {t(
                "Request correction → contributor updates",
                "수정 요청 → 기여자 수정",
                "修正を依頼 → 貢献者が更新",
              )}
            </span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <b>04</b>
            <span>
              {t(
                "Authorized maintainer merges",
                "권한 있는 관리자가 병합",
                "権限のある担当者がマージ",
              )}
            </span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="main" data-result>
        <code>main</code>
        <span>
          ←{" "}
          {t(
            "Accepted rain-label fix",
            "수락된 비 예보 수정",
            "受理した雨予報の修正",
          )}
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="note" data-boundary>
    {t(
      "A pull request is a proposal, not write access or deployment. Git history and GitHub review are different layers.",
      "PR은 제안이며 쓰기 권한이나 배포가 아닙니다. Git 이력과 GitHub 검토는 역할이 다릅니다.",
      "PRは提案であり、書き込み権限や配布ではありません。Gitの履歴とGitHubのレビューは別の役割です。",
    )}
  </p>
</section>
<style>
  section {
    container-type: inline-size;
    background: #edf0f7;
    color: #26364e;
    border: 1px solid #8593ab;
    padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 32px);
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  p,
  h2,
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }
  header > p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .review-map {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.4fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .contributor {
    padding: 18px;
    align-self: start;
    border: 2px dashed #536783;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .role {
    display: block;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .patch {
    margin: 16px 0;
    padding: 14px;
    border-left: 5px solid #536783;
    background: #edf0f7;
  }
  .contributor > p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .proposal {
    display: block;
    border-bottom: 3px solid;
    padding: 20px 0 8px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .no-write {
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  .maintainer {
    border-left: 8px solid #26364e;
    padding: 18px;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .request {
    border: 1px solid #8593ab;
    padding: 16px;
  }
  ol {
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 18px 0 0;
  }
  li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #c1c9d6;
  }
  li b {
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .main {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    background: #26364e;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .main code {
    font-weight: 750;
  }
  .note {
    margin-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid #8593ab;
    padding-top: 16px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  @container (max-width:550px) {
    .review-map {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .maintainer {
      padding: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>
